# The empty collection offers the sample deck; starting it lands on the
# deck list with the imported Getting started deck due.
wait-for No collection yet
clean
shot flashcards-empty
tap Start with the sample
wait-for Choose a deck
expect Getting started
expect 6 due
clean
shot flashcards-decks
# A card answered Again comes back at the end of the session, and the last
# card leaves a "Done for today" that says when the next ones are due.
tap Getting started
wait-for 1 of 6
tap-id answer
wait-for Answer
tap-id again
wait-for 1 of 6
tap-id answer
tap-id good
wait-for 2 of 6
tap-id answer
tap-id good
wait-for 3 of 6
tap-id answer
tap-id good
wait-for 4 of 6
tap-id answer
tap-id good
wait-for 5 of 6
tap-id answer
tap-id good
wait-for 6 of 6
clean
shot flashcards-missed-card-last
tap-id answer
tap-id good
wait-for Done for today
expect You reviewed 6 cards today.
expect-missing recorded locally
clean
shot flashcards-done-for-today
